  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ruziba-Nyamakarabo Coffee Production Improvement &amp; Marketing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to increase access to an environmentally sound washing station as well as create a revolving fund for farmers to receive direct payment for their cherries. Funds will be used to reinforce the cooperatives waste collection system and collection centers; for training in improved agricultural techniques; hiring staff; a vehicle; and to develop a marketing strategy.</narrative>
  </description>
